# A four-bar linkage (F9 Mechanisms): a ground bar held, and a crank,
# a coupler and a rocker that move in a mechanism, hinged in a loop.
# Dragging the coupler by one of its lines turns the crank and the
# rocker with it, the loop kept closed; params prints the parts'
# placements before and after. One step of undo puts them back.
file $testdata/ui/mechanism/fourbar.tlspr
menu File|Open...
params
freedom
down L 405 135
move 410 125 L
move 415 115 L
move 420 105 L
up L 420 105
params
freedom
key z ctrl
params
